latex,polymer,sellmeier,1.4435,0.0,0.0,0.020216,1.0,1.0,,1050,0.4368,1.052,"alias of polystyrene optical constants -- real latex microsphere n depends on formulation/hydration; used because example/user scripts refer to material 'latex'","Same as polystyrene: Sultanova, Kasarova & Nikolov 2009 (approximation; latex modeled as polystyrene optically)",,,,,,,
